00:00:15.080 --> 00:00:19.360
I can't really blame her, but only having bread for lunch really doesn't cut it.

00:00:19.950 --> 00:00:22.370
Well, if you like, you can have some of my side dishes. {Accompaniments is absolutely not an American thing. The closest approximation I can think of is 'snacks.'}

00:00:22.600 --> 00:00:23.940
