00:00:23.940 --> 00:00:26.540
Sorry to trouble you like this.

00:00:27.330 --> 00:00:29.470
I'll take this, then! {just living the fucking dream}

00:00:30.510 --> 00:00:32.510
It's delicious!

00:00:32.510 --> 00:00:33.470
Oh, I've got it!

00:00:33.720 --> 00:00:41.220
Hey everyone, if you have any side dishes you don't need or want, feel free to let me know! {accompaniments -> snacks}

00:00:41.220 --> 00:00:43.180
I'll accept them most graciously!

00:00:43.520 --> 00:00:45.980
What is she, a trash collector?

00:00:46.620 --> 00:00:49.410
Naminami, you got anything you don't need?

00:00:50.050 --> 00:00:54.240
Whoa! Naminami, your lunch box is <i>really</i> cute!

00:00:55.450 --> 00:00:56.340
Isn't it?

00:00:56.340 --> 00:00:57.820
It really is!

00:00:57.820 --> 00:01:00.120
Your mother is amazing, Shiku!

00:01:00.420 --> 00:01:01.410
Tsubomi...

00:01:01.710 --> 00:01:04.040
Naminami's mother passed away.

00:01:04.040 --> 00:01:04.870
Huh?

00:01:05.690 --> 00:01:07.190
I-I'm so sorry!

00:01:13.980 --> 00:01:15.940
Don't get upset over it!

00:01:15.940 --> 00:01:20.410
I'm not upset about it, so it's 
no good if you are, Hanasaki!

00:01:20.410 --> 00:01:21.930
You've gotta keep smiling, right?

00:01:23.620 --> 00:01:24.760
Yeah!

00:01:24.760 --> 00:01:27.690
Who did make this lunch box, then?

00:01:28.030 --> 00:01:28.730
Me.

00:01:28.730 --> 00:01:29.860
Huh?!

00:01:29.860 --> 00:01:33.110
My little sister tells me to make them cute, you see.

00:01:33.110 --> 00:01:37.140
That's amazing! Being able to make something like this is really neat! {She actually says 'worthy of respect', but I can't quite figure out how to make that work.}

00:01:37.140 --> 00:01:38.780
You're like a mother yourself.{YEAH, JUST RUB IT IN.}

