00:06:05.700 --> 00:06:07.680
You really need to stop worrying.

00:06:07.970 --> 00:06:09.930
I-I'm sorry...

00:06:11.080 --> 00:06:12.700
Smile, smile!

00:06:12.700 --> 00:06:14.140
You've gotta keep smiling!

00:06:14.860 --> 00:06:15.720
Right!

00:06:15.720 --> 00:06:17.780
Sis, I want this one!

00:06:17.780 --> 00:06:19.020
Okay.

00:06:19.020 --> 00:06:21.160
Hanasaki, how much is it?

00:06:21.160 --> 00:06:23.520
Let's see... 450 yen.

00:06:23.760 --> 00:06:27.650
We can bring it down a little more! How about a nice round 400 yen?

00:06:28.490 --> 00:06:29.820
How about it?!

00:06:32.020 --> 00:06:33.530
S-sure...

00:06:34.730 --> 00:06:37.280
You sure are tough, Naminami!

00:06:37.280 --> 00:06:38.580
You could outmatch any adult!

00:06:38.920 --> 00:06:40.940
