00:07:05.500 --> 00:07:07.570
Do you like it, Mom?

00:07:24.810 --> 00:07:28.710
Sis! I want to give Mom the carnation!

00:07:28.710 --> 00:07:29.260
Huh?

00:07:29.780 --> 00:07:32.700
I want her to say "Thank you!" to me!

00:07:32.700 --> 00:07:35.460
I'm sure she'll be happy with it.

00:07:35.460 --> 00:07:38.430
You can't know that for sure!

00:07:40.920 --> 00:07:43.060
Rumi, don't ask the impossible.

00:07:43.640 --> 00:07:44.610
Come on now.

00:07:44.610 --> 00:07:45.480
