00:08:05.740 --> 00:08:07.040
Welcome home.

00:08:07.040 --> 00:08:08.450
Sorry I'm late.

00:08:08.450 --> 00:08:09.440
How's dinner going?

00:08:09.440 --> 00:08:10.840
