00:10:28.440 --> 00:10:29.290
Rumi!

00:10:29.810 --> 00:10:31.360
I don't wanna!

00:10:35.520 --> 00:10:37.650
I hate you so much, Sis!

00:10:40.630 --> 00:10:42.760
