do you know what makes me happier than anything else in the world? {Why is her name spelled differently than the rest of the episode and four lines ago?}

00:18:26.120 --> 00:18:27.710
What makes you happiest?

00:18:28.080 --> 00:18:31.780
It's the smiles of my whole family.

00:18:31.780 --> 00:18:34.210
That's why no matter what, you've gotta keep smiling.

00:18:43.660 --> 00:18:44.810
I see...

00:18:46.220 --> 00:18:48.170
Those were Mom's words...

00:18:56.270 --> 00:18:57.570
Sis!

00:18:57.980 --> 00:18:59.030
Rumi?

00:18:59.030 --> 00:19:02.990
I'm sorry, Sis! I'm so sorry!

00:19:02.990 --> 00:19:05.590
I'm so sorry!

00:19:07.050 --> 00:19:09.000
I'm sorry too, Rumi.

00:19:09.580 --> 00:19:12.790
You just wanted to know more about Mom, didn't you?

00:19:14.040 --> 00:19:20.430
I just felt so sad when I remembered her that I tried to forget.

00:19:23.760 --> 00:19:27.120
If you keep crying, you'll make Mom sad, you know?

00:19:29.580 --> 00:19:30.690
Huh?

00:19:30.690 --> 00:19:33.010
Mom said this to me:

00:19:33.010 --> 00:19:37.240
"What makes me happiest is 
the smiles of my whole family.

00:19:37.240 --> 00:19:39.860
That's why you've gotta keep smiling!"

00:19:40.200 --> 00:19:43.240
I've gotta... keep smiling?

00:19:43.800 --> 00:19:44.570
That's right.

00:19:45.140 --> 00:19:46.080
Dad's smile...

00:19:46.760 --> 00:19:47.580
My smile...

00:19:48.300 --> 00:19:49.790
And your smile!

00:19:51.680 --> 00:19:56.100
When you cry, both Mom and I feel sad.

00:19:57.190 --> 00:20:00.730
There are times when we'll want to cry, but we'll get through it together.

00:20:01.480 --> 00:20:02.510
Okay?

00:20:05.680 --> 00:20:06.510
Yeah!

00:20:07.050 --> 00:20:09.350
I love you, Sis!

00:20:09.980 --> 00:20:11.580
I'm so glad.

00:20:11.580 --> 00:20:12.900
I'm so glad...

00:20:12.900 --> 00:20:14.980
I really am so glad!

00:20:15.420 --> 00:20:18.400
In the language of flowers, a carnation means "love for one's mother."

00:20:18.400 --> 00:20:22.650
Now that the sisters are reunited, their love for their mother shines through! {added 'that'}

00:20:25.860 --> 00:20:28.740
I think a Heart Seed's about to be born...

00:20:39.040 --> 00:20:43.350
With this, the Great Heart Tree has recovered a little more!

00:20:46.270 --> 00:20:47.620
Morning!

00:20:47.620 --> 00:20:49.180
Good morning!

00:20:49.180 --> 00:20:53.640
My mom really loved the carnation
 corsage you picked out for her, Tsubomi! {The word is 'corsage,' not 'cossage.' Nice phonetics, though.}

00:20:54.070 --> 00:20:59.110
And my mom was really happy with the apron you made for her, Erika!

00:20:59.400 --> 00:21:02.090
We managed to come up with some good presents in the end, didn't we?

00:21:02.090 --> 00:21:03.260
We sure did!

00:21:03.260 --> 00:21:06.270
Hanasaki! Erika! Morning!

00:21:07.720 --> 00:21:09.160
Mornin'!

00:21:09.500 --> 00:21:10.980
Good morning!

00:21:10.980 --> 00:21:12.620
Naminami, what's up?

00:21:19.810 --> 00:21:21.670
Um... I made this.

00:21:21.670 --> 00:21:23.170
Is this...

00:21:23.620 --> 00:21:25.380
Clothing designs?

00:21:25.380 --> 00:21:26.420
Yeah.

00:21:26.420 --> 00:21:32.200
The truth is, I've always been interested in 
fashion, and wanted to join the Fashion Club...

00:21:32.200 --> 00:21:34.560
I wouldn't be able to show up every day, but...

00:21:34.850 --> 00:21:36.930
Would that be all right with you two?

00:21:36.930 --> 00:21:39.680
That's totally okay! Right?

00:21:39.680 --> 00:21:41.020
We'd be glad to have you!

00:21:41.020 --> 00:21:42.580
Thank you so much!

00:21:42.580 --> 00:21:44.740
That's great, Sis!

00:21:45.840 --> 00:21:46.440
Here!

00:21:47.220 --> 00:21:47.820
Huh?

00:21:48.410 --> 00:21:50.370
Thank you for everything. {oh fuck me i thought it was done}

00:21:52.630 --> 00:21:53.630
Rumi!

00:21:54.370 --> 00:21:55.570
Smile!

00:21:56.210 --> 00:21:57.920
You've gotta keep smiling!

00:21:59.540 --> 00:22:00.360
Yeah.

